From 2e2032af47fa8f32c29f72b793a373a387e0e313 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corvid <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:39:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corvid v1: core

NVIDIA: GPU monitor and load balancing, CUDA device for NVENC, exponential
reconnect backoff. RTMP: seamless failover chain (backup stream, slate),
seamless restart when a running channel is saved, rtmps relay with
certificate checks. Security: login lockout, real client address, no
framing, guest and watch keys, accounts with roles, sealed exports,
FFmpeg file access kept in the data directory. See CHANGELOG.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UhjysExATCKDyVfUWLA89B
